ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Hamlet]
Macbeth:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Juliet]
Macbeth:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Romeo]
Macbeth:
 You are as good as the product of the difference between a big big big big hero and a hero and a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Juliet]
Juliet:
 You are as good as the quotient between Juliet and Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Othello]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Romeo:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Romeo]
Macbeth:
 You are as good as the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Juliet]
Juliet:
 You are as good as the quotient between Juliet and Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Othello]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Romeo:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Romeo]
Macbeth:
 You are as good as the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Juliet]
Juliet:
 You are as good as the quotient between Juliet and Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Othello]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Romeo:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Romeo]
Macbeth:
 You are a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Juliet]
Juliet:
 You are as good as the quotient between Juliet and Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Othello]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Romeo:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Romeo]
Macbeth:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Juliet]
Juliet:
 You are as good as the quotient between Juliet and Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Othello]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Romeo:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene VII: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Juliet]
Macbeth:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
